{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-05-03 14:13:00-04:56', 'title': 'A Substantial Transaction in the Renewable Energy Market: Migdal, a Prominent Israeli Insurance Company, Will Invest Approximately $355 Million in Global Energy Generation LLC (Doral LLC)', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MIGDAL, A PROMINENT ISRAELI INSURANCE COMPANY, WILL INVEST APPROXIMATELY $355 MILLION IN GLOBAL ENERGY GENERATION LLC (DORAL LLC). RENEWABLES.'}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-05-03 13:08:00-04:56', 'title': 'California American Water Celebrates Drinking Water Week', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CALIFORNIA AMERICAN WATER IS CELEBRATING THE ANNUAL OBSERVANCE OF DRINKING WATER WEEK, MAY 2- 8, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-05-03 09:42:00-04:56', 'title': 'Missouri American Water to Replace 7,940 Feet of Main in Bel-Ridge', 'text': 'BEL-RIDGE, MO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #INFRASTRUCTURE--MISSOURI AMERICAN WATER REPLACES 7,940 FEET OF WATER MAIN IN BEL-RIDGE TO SUPPORT WATER FLOW AND FIRE PROTECTION.'}{'symbol': 'SCHW', 'date': '2021-05-03 11:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Schwab's Volunteer Week Goes Virtual, Expands to Month of Service", 'text': 'WESTLAKE, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--6,000 SCHWAB EMPLOYEES TO SERVE MORE THAN 130 NONPROFITS NATIONWIDE DURING SCHWAB VOLUNTEER MONTH'}{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:20:00-04:56', 'title': 'Saadia Madsbjerg to be Named President of The Coca-Cola Foundation', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE COCA-COLA COMPANY TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SAADIA MADSBJERG WILL BE NAMED VICE PRESIDENT OF GLOBAL COMMUNITY AFFAIRS FOR THE COCA-COLA COMPANY AND PRESIDENT OF THE COCA-COLA FOUNDATION. MADSBJERG IS EXPECTED TO JOIN THE COMPANY JUNE 1. SHE WILL MANAGE OPERATIONS OF THE FOUNDATION, WHICH INCLUDES GRANT MAKING, FINANCIAL REQUIREMENTS AND REGULATORY COMPLIANCE FOR DOMESTIC AND INTERNATIONAL PHILANTHROPY. “I'M THRILLED TO JOIN THE COCA-COLA FOUNDATION, WHICH HAS A BUILT A"}{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2021-05-03 14:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Comcast NBCUniversal Introduces “We Belong,” a Multimillion Dollar Initiative in Support of Asian American Pacific Islander Heritage Month', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COMCAST NBCUNIVERSAL CELEBRATES ASIAN AMERICAN PACIFIC ISLANDER HERITAGE MONTH WITH A CROSS-PORTFOLIO CAMPAIGN WITH THE CENTRAL THEME: “WE BELONG.”'}{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2021-05-03 13:26:00-04:56', 'title': "Midtown Building Is First With Vehicle Chargers under Con Edison's Power-Ready Program", 'text': "NEW YORK, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0A LARGE APARTMENT BUILDING IN MIDTOWN MANHATTAN HAS THE DISTINCTION OF BEING THE FIRST PROPERTY IN THE REGION TO INSTALL ELECTRIC VEHICLE CHARGERS UNDER CON EDISON'S POWERREADY\xa0INCENTIVE PROGRAM. BUILDING OWNER SOLOW BUILDING CO. PLACED THE CHARGERS IN A GARAGE AT 685 FIRST AVENUE WITH HELP FROM POWERREADY, WHICH PROVIDES INCENTIVES TO BRING ELECTRICAL SERVICE TO EV CHARGING STATIONS."}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2021-05-03 09:45:00-04:56', 'title': "CVS Health Announces New Initiatives to Support Women's Health and Wellness in May", 'text': "WOONSOCKET, R.I., MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CVS HEALTH (NYSE: CVS) TODAY ANNOUNCED NEW INITIATIVES TO SUPPORT WOMEN'S HEALTH AND WELLNESS IN MAY, INCLUDING OFFERING NO-COST HEART HEALTH SCREENINGS FROM MAY 9 THROUGH MAY 15 AT MINUTECLINIC TO HELP WOMEN UNDERSTAND THEIR RISK FOR HEART DISEASE – THE NUMBER ONE KILLER OF WOMEN."}{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Largest Group of New Solar Projects Approved for Dominion Energy Virginia Customers', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA., MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE VIRGINIA STATE CORPORATION COMMISSION (SCC) APPROVED FRIDAY THE LARGEST GROUP OF NEW SOLAR PROJECTS FOR DOMINION ENERGY VIRGINIA CUSTOMERS.'}{'symbol': 'FITB', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:27:00-04:56', 'title': "Fifth Third Bank to Provide 1 Million Meals to Fight Hunger Across Bank's Footprint", 'text': "CINCINNATI--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIFTH THIRD BANCORP'S NEARLY 20,000 EMPLOYEES WILL CELEBRATE FIFTH THIRD DAY BY PROVIDING 1 MILLION MEALS TO THE HUNGRY."}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-05-03 14:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ohio Edison Upgrades Power System in Summit and Portage Counties', 'text': 'AKRON, OHIO, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OHIO EDISON, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), IS COMPLETING MODERNIZATION WORK IN SUMMIT AND PORTAGE COUNTIES TO HELP PREVENT POWER OUTAGES AND PROVIDE MORE FLEXIBILITY IN RESTORING POWER FASTER. THE WORK INCLUDES INSTALLATION OF NEW, AUTOMATED EQUIPMENT AND TECHNOLOGY IN SUBSTATIONS AND ALONG POWER LINES SERVING MORE THAN 30,000 CUSTOMERS IN PARTS OF MACEDONIA, TWINSBURG, NORTHFIELD, STREETSBORO AND NEARBY AREAS.'}{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2021-05-03 12:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'HP Extends First of its Kind Partner Program to Global Retailers', 'text': 'POWERFUL HP AMPLIFY PROGRAM OPTIMIZED TO DRIVE LONG-TERM GROWTH AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION ALIGNED TO EVOLVING CONSUMER LANDSCAPE POWERFUL HP AMPLIFY PROGRAM OPTIMIZED TO DRIVE LONG-TERM GROWTH AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION ALIGNED TO EVOLVING CONSUMER LANDSCAPE'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:36:00-04:56', 'title': 'DEADLINE TODAY: The Schall Law Firm Reminds Investors of a Class Action Lawsuit Against Leidos Holdings, Inc. and Encourages Investors with Losses in Excess of $100,000 to Contact the Firm', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MAY 3, 2021) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE:\xa0LDOS) ("LEIDOS" OR "THE COMPANY") FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN MAY 4, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 23, 2021, INCLUSIVE (THE...'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-05-03 23:12:00-04:56', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: Pomerantz Law Firm Investigates Claims On Behalf of Investors of Leidos Holdings, Inc. - LDOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC.\xa0("LEIDOS" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE: LDOS).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-05-03 15:28:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lilly Declares Second-Quarter 2021 Dividend and Announces Additional Share Repurchase Authorization', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) (THE "BOARD") HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021 OF\xa0$0.85\xa0PER SHARE ON OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0JUNE 10, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0MAY 14, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Lilly to Commit $5 Million to Direct Relief's Fund for Health Equity", 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS SUPPORT OF DIRECT RELIEF'S FUND FOR HEALTH EQUITY (THE FUND) WITH A $5 MILLION COMMITMENT OVER THE NEXT FIVE YEARS. THE FUND LAUNCHED IN MARCH 2020 WITH $75 MILLION RAISED AGAINST A GOAL OF $150 MILLION."}{'symbol': 'MKTX', 'date': '2021-05-03 09:42:00-04:56', 'title': 'MarketAxess launches Diversity Dealer Initiative to Expand Credit Trading Among Minority-, Women- and Veteran-Owned Broker Dealers and Leading Asset Managers', 'text': "NEW YORK, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARKETAXESS HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ: MKTX), THE OPERATOR OF A LEADING ELECTRONIC TRADING PLATFORM FOR FIXED-INCOME SECURITIES, AND THE PROVIDER OF MARKET DATA AND POST-TRADE SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL FIXED-INCOME MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE DIVERSITY DEALER INITIATIVE, A SERIES OF TECHNOLOGY ENHANCEMENTS THAT WILL ENABLE LEADING BUY-SIDE INSTITUTIONS AND MINORITY-, WOMEN- AND VETERAN-OWNED BROKER DEALERS TO MORE EASILY TRADE WITH ONE ANOTHER ON THE MARKETAXESS PLATFORM.\xa0 THE FUNCTIONALITY LEVERAGES MARKETAXESS' ANONYMOUS ALL-TO-ALL OPEN TRADING MARKETPLACE AND PROVIDES ENHANCED TRADING CONNECTIONS BY ALLOWING INVESTOR CLIENTS TO SELECT A DIVERSITY DEALER TO INTERMEDIATE AN OPEN TRADING TRANSACTION."}{'symbol': 'MCO', 'date': '2021-05-03 11:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'Commercial Real Estate Forecast: Urban Multifamily Properties Will Rebound in 2021', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #MOODYSCRE--MOODY'S ANALYTICS COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE FORECAST: URBAN MULTIFAMILY PROPERTIES WILL REBOUND IN 2021"}{'symbol': 'MS', 'date': '2021-05-03 11:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'Morgan Stanley and Howard University Announce Inaugural Class of HBCU Scholars Program', 'text': "NEW YORK & WASHINGTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MORGAN STANLEY AND HOWARD UNIVERSITY TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FIRST COHORT OF STUDENTS FROM HOWARD SELECTED TO PARTICIPATE IN MORGAN STANLEY'S INAUGURAL HBCU SCHOLARS PROGRAM, AN INTEGRATED PROGRAM TO SUPPORT STUDENTS AT THREE HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES (HBCUS). FIVE OUTSTANDING FIRST-YEAR STUDENTS HAVE BEEN SELECTED TO RECEIVE THE FOUR-YEAR SCHOLARSHIPS TO HOWARD, WHICH WILL COVER TUITION, ROOM AND BOARD IN ORDER TO FULLY REMOVE FINANCIAL BA"}{'symbol': 'NTRS', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:16:00-04:56', 'title': 'Northern Trust Universe Data: Vaccine Progress Sets Up Positive First Quarter for U.S. Institutional Plan Sponsors', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ASSETSERVICING--THE MEDIAN PLAN IN THE NORTHERN TRUST UNIVERSE GAINED 3.3% IN THE FIRST QUARTER, BUT ASSET ALLOCATIONS PRODUCED DIVERGENT RETURNS AMONG SEGMENTS.'}{'symbol': 'NTRS', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:11:00-04:56', 'title': 'Northern Trust Appoints Managing Director for Miami Private Client Advisory Team', 'text': 'MIAMI--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORTHERN TRUST WEALTH MANAGEMENT ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ANA NUÑEZ HAS BEEN NAMED SENIOR MANAGING DIRECTOR OF THE PRIVATE CLIENT ADVISORY TEAM IN THE DOWNTOWN MIAMI BRICKELL OFFICE AND KEY BISCAYNE OFFICE. SHE WILL REPORT TO ALEXANDER ADAMS, PRESIDENT OF THE SOUTH FLORIDA REGION, AND SUCCEEDS ERIC VAINDER, WHO WAS RECENTLY NAMED MARKET EXECUTIVE FOR BROWARD COUNTY. SHE WILL OVERSEE A MULTI-DISCIPLINARY TEAM OF PROFESSIONALS IN DELIVERING HOLISTIC WEALTH MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS'}{'symbol': 'PRU', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:06:00-04:56', 'title': "Orion Jean of Fort Worth, Texas named one of America's top 10 youth volunteers of 2021 by the Prudential Spirit of Community Awards", 'text': "NEWARK, N.J., MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORION JEAN, 10, OF FORT WORTH, TEXAS, WAS NAMED ONE OF AMERICA'S TOP 10 YOUTH VOLUNTEERS OF 2021 ON SUNDAY EVENING BY THE PRUDENTIAL SPIRIT OF COMMUNITY AWARDS DURING THE PROGRAM'S 26TH ANNUAL, AND SECOND FULLY VIRTUAL, NATIONAL RECOGNITION CELEBRATION."}{'symbol': 'PRU', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:05:00-04:56', 'title': "America's top 10 youth volunteers of 2021 named at 26th annual Prudential Spirit of Community Awards", 'text': "NEWARK, N.J., MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOR INITIATIVES THAT RANGE FROM ADDRESSING COVID-19 TO ADVOCATING FOR INCLUSION, 10 STUDENTS WERE NAMED AMERICA'S TOP YOUTH VOLUNTEERS OF 2021 ON SUNDAY EVENING BY THE PRUDENTIAL SPIRIT OF COMMUNITY AWARDS, A NATIONAL PROGRAM SPONSORED BY PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE NATIONAL ASSOCIATION OF SECONDARY SCHOOL PRINCIPALS (NASSP)."}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-05-03 10:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Raytheon Intelligence & Space to deploy airport screening equipment nationwide for TSA', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA., MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0RAYTHEON INTELLIGENCE & SPACE, A RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX) BUSINESS, WILL EXPAND THE DEPLOYMENT OF CHECKED BAGGAGE SCREENING EQUIPMENT TO ALL FEDERALLY MANAGED AIRPORTS NATIONWIDE UNDER A FIVE-YEAR, $318 MILLION CONTRACT WITH THE TRANSPORTATION SECURITY ADMINISTRATION.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-05-03 18:00:00-04:56', 'title': "New Zealand's Exchange and S&P Dow Jones Indices launch carbon-efficient indices", 'text': 'WELLINGTON, NEW ZEALAND, MAY 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NEW ZEALAND\'S EXCHANGE ("NZX") TODAY LAUNCHED NEW ZEALAND\'S FIRST CARBON EFFICIENT INDICES IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE WORLD\'S LEADING INDEX PROVIDER, S&P DOW JONES INDICES ("S&P DJI"), AMID RAPIDLY GROWING INVESTOR INTEREST, AND ACTION GLOBALLY TO REDUCE CARBON EMISSIONS AND ADDRESS CLIMATE CHANGE. NEW ZEALAND\'S FIRST \'CARBON LIGHT\' INDEX ALIGNED WITH BEST GLOBAL PRACTICE, THE TWO NEW INDICES, S&P/NZX 50 CARBON EFFICIENT INDEX\xa0AND S&P/NZX 50 PORTFOLIO CARBON EFFICIENT INDEX, UTILISE TRUCOST\'S ENVIRONMENTAL DATASET TO WEIGH COMPANIES LISTED ON THE NZX ACCORDING TO THEIR CARBON INTENSITY AND SECTOR IMPACT.'}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-05-03 14:33:00-04:56', 'title': 'Georgia Power continues to assess damage and restore power as storms cross through the state', 'text': 'ATLANTA, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AFTER SEVERE WEATHER CONTINUES TO CROSS THROUGH THE STATE, GEORGIA POWER CREWS ARE ASSESSING DAMAGE AND WORKING TO RESTORE POWER TO CUSTOMERS IMPACTED. SEVERE STORMS CONTINUE TO PRODUCE HIGH WINDS, HEAVY RAIN AND REPORTED TORNADOES THAT HAVE LED TO FALLEN TREES AND DOWNED POWER LINES.'}{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2021-05-03 09:31:00-04:56', 'title': 'Walgreens Introduces Mobile Clinics, Same-day Appointments Across the Country, Ensuring Ease of Access to Covid-19 Vaccine', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALGREENS INTRODUCES MOBILE CLINICS, SAME-DAY APPOINTMENTS ACROSS THE COUNTRY, ENSURING EASE OF ACCESS TO COVID-19 VACCINE'}